{"url": "https://pub-london.escribemeetings.com/Meeting.aspx?Id=be173321-8c05-45ab-86a2-57f574edbcbb&Agenda=PostMinutes&lang=English", "meeting_type": "Council", "bills": null, "present": ["J. Baechler;  B. Polhill", "B. Armstrong", "S. Orser", "W.R. Monteith", "M. Brown", "P. Hubert", "D.G. Henderson", "P. Van Meerbergen", "D. Brown", "H.L. Usher", "J.P. Bryant;", "C. Saunders"], "also_present": ["A. Zuidema", "J. Braam", "K. Dawtrey", "V. McAlea Major", "M. Ribera", "L.M. Rowe"], "remote_attendance": [], "absent": ["N. Branscombe", "J.B. Swan", "S.E. White"], "title": "MINUTES 19TH\n  MEETING", "datetime": "2014-07-21 11:32:00", "content": [{"string": "The Council meets in Special Session in the\n  Council Chambers this day at 11:32 AM.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "items": {"I": {"title": "DISCLOSURES\n  OF PECUNIARY INTEREST\n\u00a0\nNone.", "number": "I", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "II": {"title": "REVIEW OF\n  CONFIDENTIAL MATTERS TO BE CONSIDERED IN PUBLIC\n\u00a0\nNone.", "number": "II", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "III": {"title": "ADDED\n  REPORTS", "number": "III", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "1": {"title": "Disclosures of Pecuniary Interest", "number": "1", "content": [{"string": "That the following actions be taken with\n  respect to filling various Council appointments arising from recent changes\n  to the membership of the Municipal Council:\n\u00a0\na)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  J.\n  Baechler\u2019s appointment to the Civic Works Committee (CWC) BE RESCINDED and\n  W.R. Monteith BE APPOINTED to the CWC; it being noted that J. Baechler will\n  retain membership on the CWC, ex-officio;\nb)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  J.\n  Baechler\u2019s appointment to the LTC Long Term Growth Report Working Group\n  (LTCWG) BE RESCINDED and W.R. Monteith BE APPOINTED to the LTCWG;\nc)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  W.R.\n  Monteith BE APPOINTED to fill the vacancy on the Council Housing Leadership\n  Committee created by the resignation of the former Mayor;\nd)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  NO\n  ACTION BE TAKEN to fill the vacancy on the County/City Liaison Committee\n  (CCLC) created by the resignation of the former Mayor; it being noted that S.E.\n  White already holds the position of Alternate Member on the CCLC;\ne)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  J.\n  Baechler\u2019s appointment to the Creative City Committee (CCC) BE RESCINDED and\n  W.R. Monteith BE APPOINTED to the CCC;\nf)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  J.\n  Baechler\u2019s appointment to the Planning and Environment Committee (PEC) BE\n  RESCINDED; W.R. Monteith BE APPOINTED to the PEC; and B. Polhill BE APPOINTED\n  Chair of the PEC; it being noted that J. Baechler will retain membership on\n  the PEC, ex-officio;\ng)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  W.R.\n  Monteith BE APPOINTED to fill the vacancy on the City/County Waste Management\n  Steering Committee created by the resignation of the former Mayor;\nh)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  subject\n  to the acceptance of the letter of resignation from the Board of London Hydro\n  Inc., from the former Mayor, by London Hydro Inc., J. Baechler BE APPOINTED\u00a0\n  to fill the resultant vacancy;\ni)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\n  J.\n  Baechler\u2019s appointment to the\u00a0 London Transit Commission (LTC) BE RESCINDED\n  and W.R. Monteith BE APPOINTED to the LTC; and\nj)\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 J.\n  Baechler\u2019s appointment to the Upper Thames River Conservation Authority\n  (UTRCA) BE RESCINDED and W.R. Monteith BE APPOINTED to the UTRCA.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "Paragraph"}], "vote": {"rows": [{"vote": "Yeas:", "voters": ["J. Baechler", "B. Polhill", "B. Armstrong", "S. Orser", "W.R. Monteith", "M. Brown", "P. Hubert", "D.G. Henderson", "P. Van Meerbergen", "D. Brown", "H.L. Usher", "J.P. Bryant (12)"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "IV": {"title": "RECOGNITIONS\n\u00a0\nNone.", "number": "IV", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "V": {"title": "COMMUNICATIONS\n  AND PETITIONS", "number": "V", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "VI": {"title": "MOTIONS OF\n  WHICH NOTICE IS GIVEN", "number": "VI", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "VII": {"title": "REPORTS", "number": "VII", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "VIII": {"title": "DEFERRED\n  MATTERS", "number": "VIII", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "IX": {"title": "ENQUIRIES", "number": "IX", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "X": {"title": "EMERGENT\n  MOTIONS\n\u00a0\nNone.", "number": "X", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [